# No quotes around values. Escape literal $ as $$. Save as LF line endings, not CRLF.

# From the Tailscale admin console: Settings -> Keys -> Generate auth key.
# Use Reusable + Pre-approved so the container can (re)join without manual
# approval each time. Default expiry is 90 days -- this key will need
# regenerating periodically unless replaced with an OAuth client setup
# later (see docs/tailscale-remote-access.md for that option).
TS_AUTHKEY=